# A virtual object has at most as many fields in use as the limit
# FORM: Prepared
# OPTIONS: limit=MaxVirtualObjectFields:2
# RUN: pass SinkAllocations
# LOSS: MaxVirtualObjectFields f0 v3
# STATISTIC: AllocationsRemoved = 2

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
layout L0 name="Triple" fields=[{key="a" declared={type=anything}}, {key="b" declared={type=anything}}, {key="c" declared={type=anything}}]

function f0 name="threeFieldsInUse" parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=anything}, {type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: anything, v2: anything):
    v3 = NewObject -, v0, v1 layout=L0 fields=[0, 1]
    PropDefine v3, v2 key="c" receivers=[L0]
    v5 = NewObject -, v1, v2 layout=L0 fields=[0, 1]
    v6 = PropGet v3 key="a" receivers=[L0]
    v7 = PropGet v5 key="b" receivers=[L0]
    v8 = Add v6, v7
    Return v8
}
# CHECK-LABEL: function f0 name="threeFieldsInUse"
# CHECK: b0(
# CHECK-NEXT: v3:{{*}}= NewObject -, v0, v1 layout=L0 fields=[0, 1]
# CHECK-NEXT: PropDefine v3, v2 key="c"
# CHECK-NOT: NewObject
# CHECK: v6:{{*}}= PropGet v3 key="a"
# CHECK-NEXT: v7: anything = Upcast v2 castType=anything

function f1 name="twoFieldsInUseOfThree" parameters=[{type=anything}, {type=anything}] results=[{type=anything}] {
  b0(v0: anything, v1: anything):
    v2 = NewObject -, v0 layout=L0 fields=[0]
    PropDefine v2, v1 key="c" receivers=[L0]
    v4 = PropGet v2 key="c" receivers=[L0]
    Return v4
}
# CHECK-LABEL: function f1 name="twoFieldsInUseOfThree"
# CHECK: b0(
# CHECK-NEXT: v4: anything = Upcast v1 castType=anything
# CHECK-NEXT: Return v4
